### Listar todos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/padron-electoral

### Crear un registro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/padron-electoral
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cui": "1234567890101",
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "López",
  "departamento": "Guatemala",
  "municipio": "Mixco"
}

### Actualizar (cambia el 1 por el id real)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/padron-electoral/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cui": "1234567890101",
  "nombre": "Ana María",
  "apellido": "López",
  "departamento": "Guatemala",
  "municipio": "Mixco"
}

### Eliminar (cambia el 1 por el id real)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/padron-electoral/1

